+</style>
+<div class="wrap">
+  <header style="display:grid;gap:6px">
+    <h1>Naive dependency map, as built</h1>
+    <p class="sub">Read from the code of <code>everything-ecosystem</code> at commit <code id="head"></code>, not from any design doc. Each box is a part: a folder, with <code>schema/</code> split into core, checks and lints. An arrow means the part above imports the part below. Select a part to trace what it depends on and what depends on it.</p>
+  </header>
+  <section class="facts" aria-label="Summary">
+    <div class="fact"><b>354</b><span>source files (site excluded)</span></div>
+    <div class="fact"><b>627</b><span>imports between them</span></div>
+    <div class="fact knot"><b>12 of 39</b><span>parts tangled in one knot: each reaches every other</span></div>
+    <div class="fact kernel"><b>4 · 1</b><span>files pass the kernel test · the engine test</span></div>
+    <div class="fact"><b>236</b><span>non-test files no layer manifest lists</span></div>
+    <div class="fact"><b>14</b><span>npm packages imported</span></div>
+  </section>
+  <section class="main">
+    <div class="graph">
+      <div class="legend"><span><i class="lk"></i>in the knot</span><span><i class="lr"></i>holds a kernel</span><span><i class="ln"></i>other part</span><span style="color:var(--accent)">— depends on</span><span style="color:var(--kernel)">— depended on by</span></div>
+      <svg id="g" role="img" aria-label="Dependency graph of Naive's parts"></svg>
+    </div>
+    <aside id="panel" aria-live="polite"></aside>
+  </section>
+  <section class="notes">
+    <div class="note">
