+    { "belongs-to": "is_a" }),
+  L("classified-as", "classified as", "An outside body assigned V a code in a scheme (SIC 7372 on Anthropic's S-1). Evidence for belongs-to, not the same thing: a code can be wrong, and membership needs no code.",
